      "title": "GNSS: ensure GAL nominal page type for data word handoff",
      "message": "GNSS: ensure GAL nominal page type for data word handoff\n\nThe GAL data word handoff needs the GAL even and odd pages within the\nsame UBX-RXM-SFRBX message to be of nominal page type (not alert type).\nEnsure that this is the case (also fixing a related clang analyzer\nfinding).\n",
